"Ekran G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleri 3.png", "id": "1974880883485274", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_1974880890151940_4352513892703214691_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lII2mCcHDpEQ7kNvwGMlLl-&_nc_oc=AdrDsqrUZUCv66W2RhS3ZX18cXqfN1c5r1lKjkWSUj0KyQqtFtJcY-a-k2h_47XIWfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS9t4JXh1PrIqSn06AHACA_aXo3fUn-B_7EVm8WOYBCYA&oe=6B0DCC9D"}, {"file_name": "Ekran G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleri 4.png", "id": "1130705156110864", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1130705169444196_7388903232513006247_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c9YYzCTh9JkQ7kNvwHBPLCn&_nc_oc=Adqm3ohJbpZ-2yg-1xqDvF-Jwl7iHAHNO7z01Olh65Rr076H-yleiZ11zHPIis6HqCg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRzjnFVkUHXzy03BQb9go2XPaZz4PyFc26ogsaXkmvVmQ&oe=6B0DCA47"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Fragman - Cover image.png", "id": "1660512075856098", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1660512079189431_8403720212030657202_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8wNP_zUHGNsQ7kNvwFmFaIz&_nc_oc=Adr9ssGKaZ-DEEdvxfVi2GXzKTQY43R9YTpVczQ0Rg70qC7SwYyx0w4V3bxci1nQU6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQndfOTAc4DgPRbyh0oXJ-UuvGhWhDAJ_AsD_C_uMuXEg&oe=6B0DBE54"}, "display_name": "Floor 9", "keywords": ["anomaly", "hotel", "horror", "liminal", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Nine floors down. Pay attention.\n\nHotel Liminal gives you one corridor and two buttons. One says there is an anomaly. One says there is not. Only one of them takes you closer to the exit.\n\nStep out of the lift and walk the floor in your own headset. Lean in to a painting, turn to check the door behind you, then reach out and press the lift's buttons with your own hand. A door that was closed is open. A painting hangs an inch lower than it did a floor ago. Or nothing has moved at all, and the only thing standing between you and the next floor is your own doubt.\n\n\u2022 Nine floors, one way out. Every mistake costs you the entire descent.\n\u2022 Two buttons, no hints. No map, no marker, no going back.\n\u2022 A hotel built to be looked at closely: warm lights, patterned carpet, paintings on every wall.\n\u2022 Sound doing half the work. Put on headphones and play it in the dark.\n\u2022 A focused run. Most players reach the exit in under an hour.\n\nComfort options: snap or smooth turning, head- or hand-relative walking, a tunnel vignette, seated or standing play, room-scale walking and a left- or right-handed pointer.\n\nThe exit is nine floors below you. Take your time.", "short_description": "Nine floors down to the exit of Hotel Liminal. Walk each corridor, look closely, and press the lift button you believe in: anomaly, or no anomaly. One mistake sends you back to the top."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1006604815082750", "locale": "tr_TR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Floor 9", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dokuz kat a\u015fa\u011f\u0131. Dikkat et.\n\nHotel Liminal sana bir koridor ve iki d\u00fc\u011fme veriyor. Biri anomali var diyor. Di\u011feri yok diyor. Seni \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015fa yakla\u015ft\u0131ran yaln\u0131zca biri.\n\nAsans\u00f6rden \u00e7\u0131k ve kat\u0131 kendi g\u00f6zl\u00fc\u011f\u00fcnle y\u00fcr\u00fc. Bir tabloya yakla\u015f, arkandaki kap\u0131ya d\u00f6n\u00fcp bak, sonra uzan ve asans\u00f6r\u00fcn d\u00fc\u011fmelerine kendi elinle bas. Kapal\u0131 olan bir kap\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131k. Bir tablo bir \u00f6nceki kattakinden bir parmak daha a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da as\u0131l\u0131. Ya da hi\u00e7bir \u015fey de\u011fi\u015fmedi ve seninle bir sonraki kat aras\u0131nda duran tek \u015fey kendi \u015f\u00fcphen.\n\n\u2022 Dokuz kat, tek \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f. Her hata b\u00fct\u00fcn ini\u015fe mal olur.\n\u2022 \u0130ki d\u00fc\u011fme, ipucu yok. Harita yok, i\u015faret yok, geri d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yok.\n\u2022 Dikkatle bak\u0131lmak i\u00e7in yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir otel: s\u0131cak \u0131\u015f\u0131klar, desenli hal\u0131, her duvarda tablolar.\n\u2022 \u0130\u015fin yar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ses yap\u0131yor. Kulakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 tak ve karanl\u0131kta oyna.\n\u2022 Odakl\u0131 bir oyun. Oyuncular\u0131n \u00e7o\u011fu \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015fa bir saatten k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede ula\u015f\u0131yor.\n\nKonfor se\u00e7enekleri: ad\u0131m ad\u0131m ya da ak\u0131c\u0131 d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f, kafa ya da el y\u00f6n\u00fcne g\u00f6re y\u00fcr\u00fcme, t\u00fcnel vinyeti, oturarak ya da ayakta oynama, oda \u00f6l\u00e7e\u011finde y\u00fcr\u00fcme ve sol ya da sa\u011f el i\u00e7in lazer.\n\n\u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f dokuz kat a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da. Acele etme.", "short_description": "Hotel Liminal'in \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131na dokuz kat var. Her koridoru y\u00fcr\u00fc, dikkatle bak ve inand\u0131\u011f\u0131n asans\u00f6r d\u00fc\u011fmesine bas: anomali var, ya da yok. Tek bir hata seni en \u00fcste geri g\u00f6nderir."}]}, "developer_name": "Room Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://roomgames.co/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Room Games", "support_website_url": "https://roomgames.co/", "website_url": "https://roomgames.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages